  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Verdensm&#xe5;lsfilm til undervisning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danes&#x2019; support for development cooperation is stable at around 60% of the population. But it is clear that the public&#x2019;s knowledge and understanding og developments in the world&#x2019;s poorest countries remains limited &#x2013; and 20% of the Danes now actively avoid following the news &#x2013; of any kind. 

If we are to maintain &#x2013; or preferably increase &#x2013; support for development cooperation and get people actively engaged in a more sustainable world, we need to communicate to a wider audience and reach them through the channels they interact with already. Campaign activities are one of the tools used by the MFA Engagement Team to reach a wider auduence.</narrative>
  </description>
